  "sourceTitle": "Easy Party Cookie Recipe",
  "sourceText": "Easy Party Cookie Recipe\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, January 2, 2010 - 1:05am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup shortening\n1 cup brown sugar\n1/2 cup sugar\n2 teaspoons vanilla\n2 eggs\n2 1/4 cups flour\n1 teaspoon soda\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 1/2 cups M\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend shortening and sugars. Beat in vanilla and eggs. Add dry ingredients. Stir in 1 cup candy - reserve remaining candies for decorating. Bake at 375 degrees for 10 to 12 minutes until golden brown. Makes 6 dozen.",
